    "title": "新增/修改/删除客户类别",
    "keywords": "",
    "description": "",
    "content": "<h2 id=\"%E6%96%B0%E5%A2%9E%E5%AE%A2%E6%88%B7%E7%B1%BB%E5%88%AB\" tabindex=\"-1\">新增客户类别<a class=\"header-anchor\" href=\"#%E6%96%B0%E5%A2%9E%E5%AE%A2%E6%88%B7%E7%B1%BB%E5%88%AB\" aria-hidden=\"true\"></a></h2>\n<p><video src=\"https://ks3-cn-beijing.ksyun.com/zhjwebsite/uploads/202402/4c10873c3459f7fc9fb1c8a7cebe3a03.mp4\" controls=\"controls\" class=\"my-video\" style=\"max-width:100%\">\n\n\n视频描述\n</video></p>\n<p>1.操作路径：【客户】-【客户】-点击左侧客户分类【编辑】-右侧【+】。</p>\n<p><img src=\"https://ks3-cn-beijing.ksyun.com/zhjwebsite/uploads/202401/698f558769ad6a7be2fa6cd6f33cd883.png\" alt=\"Description\"></p>\n<p>2.如果要设置一级类别就点击全部后面的加号新增类别,上级类别选择无，然后保存即可。</p>\n<p><img src=\"https://ks3-cn-beijing.ksyun.com/zhjwebsite/uploads/202401/5121e23d5c50add88d89a2d6d7d9a5b8.png\" alt=\"Description\"></p>\n<p><img src=\"https://ks3-cn-beijing.ksyun.com/zhjwebsite/uploads/202401/9a1be5a880a48f1b8047714d3cde5b4e.png\" alt=\"Description\"></p>\n<p>3.如果要新增二级类别，就点击对应类别后面的加号新增类别。</p>\n<p><img src=\"https://ks3-cn-beijing.ksyun.com/zhjwebsite/uploads/202401/6b883d3faff3711a025b55277392534a.png\" alt=\"Description\"></p>\n<p><img src=\"https://ks3-cn-beijing.ksyun.com/zhjwebsite/uploads/202401/7c028eda77b406cf3e574b60e1a36b35.png\" alt=\"Description\"></p>\n<h2 id=\"%E4%BF%AE%E6%94%B9%E5%AE%A2%E6%88%B7%E7%B1%BB%E5%88%AB\" tabindex=\"-1\">修改客户类别<a class=\"header-anchor\" href=\"#%E4%BF%AE%E6%94%B9%E5%AE%A2%E6%88%B7%E7%B1%BB%E5%88%AB\" aria-hidden=\"true\"></a></h2>\n<p>1.操作路径：【客户】-【客户】-点击左侧客户分类【编辑】-选中要修改类别然后点击中间的编辑按钮修改即可。</p>\n<p><img src=\"https://ks3-cn-beijing.ksyun.com/zhjwebsite/uploads/202401/a85b5699d2f9609e9ee92be335884d7a.png\" alt=\"Description\"></p>\n<p>2.可以修改类别的名称和上级类别</p>\n<p><img src=\"https://ks3-cn-beijing.ksyun.com/zhjwebsite/uploads/202401/3bf84bdf5b9c84492ac4d519a194b986.png\" alt=\"Description\"></p>\n<h2 id=\"%E5%88%A0%E9%99%A4%E5%AE%A2%E6%88%B7%E7%B1%BB%E5%88%AB\" tabindex=\"-1\">删除客户类别<a class=\"header-anchor\" href=\"#%E5%88%A0%E9%99%A4%E5%AE%A2%E6%88%B7%E7%B1%BB%E5%88%AB\" aria-hidden=\"true\"></a></h2>\n<p>1.操作路径：【客户】-【客户】-点击左侧客户分类【编辑】-选中要修改类别然后点击最后面的删除按钮。</p>\n<p><img src=\"https://ks3-cn-beijing.ksyun.com/zhjwebsite/uploads/202401/05ba6a25baeee7efdf0d11791e5ef6c8.png\" alt=\"Description\"></p>\n<p>2.注意：类别名称下面没有子类别和商品信息的类别才支持删除。</p>\n",
